    "plot_flow_network(\n",
    "    \"outputs/sol_mincost_ubc.txt\",\n",
    "    \"Minimum-Cost Routing to UBC\",\n",
    "    nodes\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "dfd001a6-9f0b-4573-82e7-4caff3a38211",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The minimum-cost solution concentrates passenger flow along relatively direct corridors leading toward `UBC`. This gives a concrete routing plan for serving the specified demand at minimum cost."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "9f382fbd-3c08-4e34-88ad-7626aa5206b8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Multi-Destination Minimum-Cost Routing\n",
    "\n",
    "The previous model considered passenger demand to a single destination: `UBC`. A more realistic system must meet demand to multiple destinations simultaneously.\n",
    "\n",
    "For this scenario, passenger flow is separated by destination: one group is traveling to `Downtown`, while the other is traveling to `UBC`. The model assumes simultaneous demand of 5,000 passengers per hour into `Downtown` and 4,000 passengers per hour into `UBC`, supplied by multiple boundary source nodes. Both groups share the same corridor-capacity constraints.\n",
    "\n",
    "As before, the analysis uses the expanded transit network with the added rail lines. The objective is to find the minimum-cost routing that satisfies both destination demands."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "1ce2254c-cea8-40c2-97f3-64ee5d17f50b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "OPTIMAL LP SOLUTION FOUND\n",
      "Wrote solution to outputs/sol_mincost_multi_destination.txt\n",
      "Total cost:       10825.5090 $\n",
      "Model has been successfully processed\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "result = run_glpk(\n",
    "    \"models/mincost_multi_destination.mod\",\n",
    "    \"data/mincost_multi_destination.dat\"\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1632abce-351d-4e6c-84b0-0fd08009281b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The multi-destination solution satisfies both the `Downtown` and `UBC` passenger demands with a total transportation cost of approximately **\\$10,826 per hour**.\n",
    "\n",
    "The plot below separates the two destination-based passenger flows, highlighting corridors used primarily by `Downtown`-bound passengers, `UBC`-bound passengers, or both groups."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "2e310786-edd3-4f59-a401-a1b183d4acd6",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 1150x750 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
