   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "068b19fb-0091-4388-9056-8f5a5f2f1eb0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Negative dual values indicate corridors where additional capacity would reduce total routing cost. The more negative the value, the larger the estimated cost reduction.\n",
    "\n",
    "For example, a dual value of **-0.3112** means that increasing that corridor's capacity by one passenger per hour would reduce total transportation cost by approximately **\\$0.31 per hour**.\n",
    "\n",
    "The strongest signal appears on the connection from `MarineGranville` to `Marine41st`, which currently has zero capacity. This suggests that a more direct connection from the southern Marine corridor toward `UBC` could reduce the total cost by giving UBC-bound passengers a shorter route through the network."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d82b697e-5b58-4b51-aed7-7bb3f9fff1e7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Targeted Route Improvement\n",
    "\n",
    "The sensitivity analysis suggests that adding capacity between `MarineGranville` and `Marine41st` could improve routing efficiency. In the current network, passengers traveling from `MarineGranville` toward `UBC` must first move north through `Granville41st` before heading west to `Marine41st`.\n",
    "\n",
    "To address the inefficiency, bus route `480` is modified to include a direct connection from `MarineGranville` to `Marine41st`, bypassing `Granville41st`.\n",
    "\n",
    "The multi-destination model is then reoptimized with the same demand assumptions to evaluate how this route modification affects total cost."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "39fbb2da-8890-4185-9dae-942d11be82db",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "OPTIMAL LP SOLUTION FOUND\n",
      "Wrote solution to outputs/sol_mincost_route_improvement.txt\n",
      "Total cost:       10655.1654 $\n",
      "Model has been successfully processed\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "result = run_glpk(\n",
    "    \"models/mincost_multi_destination.mod\",\n",
    "    \"data/mincost_route_improvement.dat\"\n",
    ")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e88f6643-edba-4458-8393-25ffa883d49e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The route modification reduces total transportation cost from approximately **\\$10,826 per hour** to approximately **\\$10,655 per hour**, a savings of about **\\$170 per hour** under the same passenger-demand assumptions.\n",
    "\n",
    "This supports the sensitivity analysis: adding direct capacity from `MarineGranville` to `Marine41st` creates a more efficient path for UBC-bound passengers from the southern Marine corridor."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "001dd4b1-2bfc-4c9a-a213-b90d8b7b5880",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
